---
import { published, dateLabel } from "../lib/content";
const posts = await published();
const tags = [...new Set(posts.flatMap((p) => p.data.tags))];
---

<div class="city-home">
  <section class="city-hero" aria-labelledby="city-title">
    <picture>
      <source
        media="(max-width: 600px)"
        srcset="/images/anime-city-mobile.webp"
      />
      <img
        src="/images/anime-city-hero.webp"
        width="1280"
        height="720"
        fetchpriority="high"
        alt="暮色中的动漫城市，列车穿过屋顶间，窗户亮起温暖的灯光"
      />
    </picture>
    <div class="city-hero-copy">
      <p>在日常里，遇见一点不平凡。</p>
      <h1 id="city-title">把故事，留在页间。</h1>
      <a href="#recent">
        往下读读 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="city-content">
    <section class="city-feed" id="recent">
      <header>
        <h2>最近写下的</h2>
        <a href="/posts/">全部文章 ↗</a>
      </header>
      {posts.map((post) => (
        <article class="city-post">
          <div class="city-post-meta">
            <span>{post.data.tags[0]}</span>
            <time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>
              {dateLabel(post.data.date)}
            </time>
          </div>
          <h3>
            <a href={"/posts/" + post.id + "/"}>{post.data.title}</a>
          </h3>
          <p>{post.data.description}</p>
          <a class="city-read" href={"/posts/" + post.id + "/"}>
            {post.kind === "tsx" ? "打开互动文章" : "继续阅读"}{" "}
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </section>
    <aside class="city-aside">
      <section class="city-about">
        <div class="city-stamp" aria-hidden="true">
          页
        </div>
        <h2>你好，欢迎路过。</h2>
        <p>这里写代码，也写生活。收藏一些想法，记录那些值得停留的瞬间。</p>
        <a href="/about/">关于这个空间 ↗</a>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>沿着话题走走</h2>
        <div class="city-tags">
          {tags.map((t) => (
            <a href={"/tags/" + encodeURIComponent(t) + "/"}>{t}</a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="city-rss">
        <h2>下次再见。</h2>
        <p>新的故事，会沿着订阅抵达。</p>
        <a href="/rss.xml">通过 RSS 订阅 ↗</a>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
